<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns AA - to Swedish Nat'l Housing samurais.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns AA - to Swedish Nat'l Housing samurais.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp said on Monday that it had assigned its AA- rating to the Swedish National Housing Finance Corp's 25 billion yen of five percent yen/U.S. dollar dual-currency bonds due on January 27, 2000.</p>
<p>It said the outlook for the rating was negative.</p>
</text>
